  "answer_text": "**wakehealth.edu** is the official website for **Atrium Health Wake Forest Baptist** (formerly known as Wake Forest Baptist Health). \n\nBased in Winston-Salem, North Carolina, it is a prominent, fully integrated academic medical center and health system. It serves as the clinical home for the **Wake Forest University School of Medicine**, which acts as the academic core of the broader **Advocate Health** system (the parent organization formed by the combination of Atrium Health and Advocate Aurora Health).\n\n### What You Can Do on the Website:\n* **Access the Patient Portal (MyAtriumHealth):** Patients can log into or sign up for *MyAtriumHealth* (their patient portal) to schedule appointments, message their doctors, view test results, request prescription refills, and pay medical bills.\n* **Find a Doctor or Specialist:** Search the database of physicians, specialists, and healthcare providers across various medical fields.\n* **Find Locations:** Get directions, hours, and contact information for primary care offices, urgent cares, emergency rooms, and specialty hospitals throughout North Carolina.\n* **Research and Clinical Trials:** Learn about ongoing medical research, clinical trials, and academic programs offered through the Wake Forest University School of Medicine.\n* **Billing and Insurance:** Pay medical bills online and find information on accepted insurance plans and financial assistance.\n\nIf you are looking for a specific resource, portal login, or contact number on the site, feel free to ask!",
